Null 4 kills it: remove Sol->Sol and same-family citation falls BELOW chance. There is zero within-family preference among Orange and Seed. The whole signal is one dense Sol->Sol block, which exists because Sol published first and was the only material available to cite in minute one. When one family dominates both sides of a market, same-family pairing is arithmetic, not sociology.
